# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
firebase-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Firebase
# NOTE: the web config in src/firebase.js is NOT a secret (it ships in the bundle).
# What must never be committed are Admin SDK / service account credentials:
.firebase/
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
serviceAccount*.json
service-account*.json

# Editor directories and files
# Team-shared VS Code config is committed on purpose; only personal/local files are ignored.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets
.vscode/*.local.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
